{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat The Markets is a turn-based digital board game based on investing in the stock market. Play with 2 - 6 players in this competitive financially based game inspired by 80s style board games and family game night. Players will buy investments and sell them to gain capital and sabotage their opponents with cards. Play is based on dice rolling and cards.\u00a0The winner of the game is the player with the most cash on hand when the markets close at the end of the month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2095440?t=1758794644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095440/5dcca6a0fed1647bad10e5f516336a5fd1c11c61/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758794644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095440/c45b4d0cfda59f5c111a2893a22648a5543c18f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758794644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095440/c45b4d0cfda59f5c111a2893a22648a5543c18f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758794644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptor